/-!
A finite certificate for the exact local graph in Model.lean. One selected
control and one escape rank are stored per state. Successors are recomputed
from the arithmetic definition; no edge or integer-fixture table is trusted.
The theorem concerns universal closure in this finite graph only. It supplies
no ordinary-integer projection/realization theorem, no arbitrary-path
realization, no original neutral-band exclusion, and no Lychrel result.
-/
namespace Agent115.CentralWindow

set_option maxRecDepth 10000
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000

